              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. Light armour +3, shield +2 or (on foot) large shield +3. May ride a horse (free). Army Standard Bearer. (Hannibal p.22)</characteristic>
