              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, thrusting spear, light armour, large shield. Fought in a fairly close formation: when they charge they can fight in two ranks with their thrusting spears (front only). (Hannibal p.23)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="d5bf-e510-3ab2-25f7" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
